# AI trainer context routing

Keep this pointer tiny — **do not** inline DESIGN/BACKLOG here.

| Need | Read | Do not |
|------|------|--------|
| **Tasks** | [`ai/BACKLOG.md`](../../BACKLOG.md) | Re-litigate shipped rows |
| **Contract / why** | [`ai/DESIGN.md`](../../DESIGN.md) + Kotlin `backend/.../api/ai/dto/` | GUI `MatchSnapshot` / `frontend/` for obs or legals |
| **How to run** | [`ai/README.md`](../../README.md) | Invent CLI flags |
| **Train/eval CLI** | Phase / profile / scenario concepts; edit source for one-offs | Model file paths, before/after duals, speculative knobs — asks are always phase-relative |
| **Harness code** | `ai/gridiron_ai/`, `ai/scripts/` | Treat GUI submit/SSE as the train loop |
| **Eval / run results** | Only paths the user named under `ai/output/` | Blind-scan `ai/output/` (cursorignored) |

Trainer API is `/api/ai/...` — not the browser client. GUI is in scope only for `play_vs_human` UX.
